  "title": "Quietly Peppery Dutch Goat Fried Rice",
  "description": "A lazy Sunday Dutch dish featuring goat meat and a blend of spices, quietly peppery and flaky, made with fry-grind-rice-khao-khua, perfect for a relaxing day at home.",
