  "instructions": [
    "Heat the khao khuha oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the diced goat meat and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add the cooked rice to the skillet, breaking up any clumps with a spatula.",
    "Stir in the soy sauce, black pepper, and salt, and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust the seasoning as needed.",
    "Transfer the fried rice to a serving platter and garnish with chopped scallions.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
